ucsc_twoBit - minimal build of faToTwoBit / twoBitToFa / twoBitInfo
====================================================================

This directory contains:

  * makefile, udcLocal.c, htsStub.c
      Build glue and small local stubs written for this minimal build
      (udcLocal.c and htsStub.c replace kent's udc/net/https code and the
      htslib tabix code, which are not needed for local-file use on an
      offline cluster).

  * src/
      A minimal, unmodified snapshot of the UCSC Genome Browser source
      tree ("kent src"), taken from:
        https://github.com/ucscGenomeBrowser/kent
      It contains only the sources required to build the three programs
      above (src/inc headers, selected src/lib and src/lib/font sources,
      htslib headers, and the three program sources under src/utils).

