The kent source code in src/ is licensed by UC Regents.  All files in
this snapshot come from the command-line tools and their libraries,
which the upstream LICENSE explicitly releases under the MIT License
("They can be redistributed in any way necessary").  The non-commercial
parts of the upstream tree (the interactive Genome Browser web code in
