    these, bedToBigBed, wigToBigWig and the tagStorm tools and the parasol job
    scheduler.
2. A public domain "with attribution" license for sorting bigWig files, 
   see src/optimalLeaf/LICENSE

NON-COMMERCIAL licenses:

